{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26022","headline":"云溪竹园翁 · 鲍溶","name":"云溪竹园翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"硠硠云溪里，翠竹和云生。\n古泉积涧深，竦竦如刻成。\n楚客卧云老，世间无姓名。\n因兹千亩业，以代双牛耕。\n乱林不可留，寸茎不可轻。\n风煖鬬出地，仰齐故年茎。\n幽室结白茅，密叶罗衆清。\n照水寒澹荡，对山绿峥嵘。\n苍松含古貌，秋桂俨白英。\n相看受天风，深夜戛击声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}